Z||000000||FOCOSEVA||07-25-2001||08:48 AM||||Greetings everyone,  Time is growing short and the 2001 Fiero Festival in Williamsburg, Virginia will be upon us before you know it. If you haven't yet sent in your registration, please send it to me at the address below instead of FOCOA. This is because Fiero Phil & Gloria are departing FOCOA HQ today, and will not be returning until after the Festival. You can send it by "2-day priority mail", or if you're really in a crunch you can send it by Federal Express or other non Post Office courier. Remember, non-Post Office couriers do not deliver to Post Office boxes! Thanks, we hope you'll join us at the Festival. Curry Obenshain<P>Fiero Festival<BR>6451 Hickory Fork Rd.<BR>P.O. Box 297<BR>White Marsh, Va. 23183||||reg||4
